<title>SWITZERLAND: Sandoz H1 profit rises 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Sandoz H1 profit rises 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1,241	     vs 1,112</p>
<p> Oper net			 1,632	     vs 1,607</p>
<p> Oper net excl divestitures 1,632	     vs 1,497</p>
<p> Sales			    7,871	     vs 8,676</p>
<p> Sales excl. divestitures   7,871	     vs 7,375</p>
<p> Cash flow			1,607	     vs 1,536</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Sandoz AG. Analysts were forecasting 14.5 pct profit rise to 1.26 billion. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
